Autoritatea contractantă va răspunde, în mod clar și complet, tuturor solicitărilor de clarificări/informaticilor suplimentare în a 11-a zi înainte de data limită de depunere a ofertelor.'}]}, {'test_data_suite_oid': '6809845b9090eed3deccce56', 'test_data_suite_id': 'sampling_eforms_all_can-1.6', 'test_data_oid': '6809845c9090eed3deccce60', 'test_data_id': '276355-2023', 'xpaths': [{'xpath': 'urn:ContractAwardNotice/cac:ProcurementProject/cbc:Description', 'value': 'LMR laboratory quality system is ISO 17025 accredited by ACCREDIA, the Italian Accreditation Body for 24 test methods. LMR benefits of several contracts for IT, quality and analytical support. Since LMR has limited capabilities in processing and measuring radioactive and potentially radioactive samples, to satisfy the demand of radiochemical analyses from NDWDM services, it has been decided to outsource part of such analyses to a Contractor. Contractor will perform sample analyses in its premises. Contractor has to perform radiochemical analyses of radioactive and potentially radioactive samples.'}]}, {'test_data_suite_oid': '6809845b9090eed3deccce56', 'test_data_suite_id': 'sampling_eforms_all_can-1.6', 'test_data_oid': '6809845c9090eed3deccce61', 'test_data_id': '703591-2023', 'xpaths': [{'xpath': 'ContractAwardNotice/cac:ProcurementProject/cbc:Description', 'value': 'The subject of this tender is the establishment of a framework contract for the supply of ammunition rounds as follows: Lot 1 - 9mm FMJ, Lot 2 - 9mm JHP, Lot 3 - 9 Subsonic, Lot 4 - 5.56 NATO FMJ, Lot 5 - 5.56x45mm JHP, Lot 6 - 5.56x45mm AP, Lot 7 - Rubber pellets, Lot 8 - Plastic pellets'}]}, {'test_data_suite_oid': '6809845b9090eed3deccce56', 'test_data_suite_id': 'sampling_eforms_all_can-1.6', 'test_data_oid': '6809845c9090eed3deccce62', 'test_data_id': '703907-2023', 'xpaths': [{'xpath': 'ContractAwardNotice/cac:ProcurementProject/cbc:Description', 'value': 'Übersetzungsleistungen'}, {'xpath': 'ContractAwardNotice/cac:ProcurementProject/cbc:Description', 'value': 'Prestations de traduction'}]}, {'test_data_suite_oid': '6809845b9090eed3deccce56', 'test_data_suite_id': 'sampling_eforms_all_can-1.6', 'test_data_oid': '6809845c9090eed3deccce63', 'test_data_id': '175165-2024', 'xpaths': [{'xpath': 'ContractAwardNotice/cac:ProcurementProject/cbc:Description', 'value': 'Predmet javnega naročila je nakup in dobava pisarniškega materiala, tonerjev in kartuš ter okolju manj obremenjujočega papirja za fotokopirne stroje in tiskalnike za Univerzo v Mariboru. Predmet javnega naročila je specificiran v tehničnih specifikacijah, ponudbenem predračunu (za vsak sklop) ter vzorcu okvirnega sporazuma. Ocenjene količine blaga so orientacijske narave.'}]}, {'test_data_suite_oid': '6809845b9090eed3deccce56', 'test_data_suite_id': 'sampling_eforms_all_can-1.6', 'test_data_oid': '6809845c9090eed3deccce64', 'test_data_id': '443359-2024', 'xpaths': [{'xpath': 'ContractAwardNotice/cac:ProcurementProject/cbc:Description', 'value': 'Predmet javnega naročila je vzdrževanje, servis in nadgradnja laboratorijske opreme Miltenyi Biotec in nakup ter dobava ustreznih reagentov.'}]}, {'test_data_suite_oid': '6809845b9090eed3deccce56', 'test_data_suite_id': 'sampling_eforms_all_can-1.6', 'test_data_oid': '6809845c9090eed3deccce65', 'test_data_id': '470441-2024', 'xpaths': [{'xpath': 'ContractAwardNotice/cac:ProcurementProject/cbc:Description', 'value': 'Dobave zobozdravstvenega materiala iz posameznih kategorij blaga za obdobje do 30. 6. 2025'}]}], 'is_covered': True, 'xpath_conditions': [{'xpath_condition': "not exists(/*/ext:UBLExtensions/ext:UBLExtension/ext:ExtensionContent/efext:EformsExtension/efac:NoticeSubType/cbc:SubTypeCode[contains('1 2 3 4 5 6 E1 E2', text())])", 'meets_xpath_condition': False}], 'message': None}

